{"ticker":"HLT","updated":"2026-10-23T23:04:35Z","profile":{"longName":"Hilton Worldwide Holdings Inc.","shortName":"Hilton Worldwide Holdings Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Lodging","country":"United States","website":"https://www.hilton.com","fullTimeEmployees":182000,"marketCap":78689443840,"trailingPE":51.265396,"forwardPE":33.549816,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":15.417211,"pegRatio":1.48,"targetMeanPrice":355.4074,"targetHighPrice":390.0,"targetLowPrice":270.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":27,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.025,"earningsGrowth":0.141,"grossMargins":0.79036003,"operatingMargins":0.62987,"profitMargins":0.31034002,"totalRevenue":5104000000,"beta":1.105,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":364.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":253.54,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.17},"summary":"Hilton Worldwide Holdings Inc., a hospitality company, engages in managing, franchising, and leasing hotels and resorts. It operates in two segments, Management and Franchise, and Ownership. The company engages in the hotel management and licensing of its brand names, trademarks, and service marks. It operates a brand portfolio of luxury, lifestyle, full service, focused service, all-suites hotel, and timeshare under the Waldorf Astoria Hotels & Resorts, LXR Hotels & Resorts, Conrad Hotels & Resorts, Signia by Hilton, NoMad, Canopy by Hilton, Graduate by Hilton, Tempo by Hilton, Motto by Hilton, Hilton Hotels & Resorts, DoubleTree by Hilton, Curio Collection by Hilton, Tapestry Collection by Hilton, Outset Collection by Hilton, Embassy Suites by Hilton, Homewood Suites by Hilton, Home2 Suites by Hilton, LivSmart Studios by Hilton, Hilton Garden Inn, Hampton by Hilton, Tru by Hilton, Spark by Hilton, Hilton Grand Vacations, Small Luxury Hotels of the World, AutoCamp, and Hilton Honors brand names. The company has operations in North America, South America, and Central America, including various Caribbean nations; Europe, the Middle East, and Africa; and the Asia Pacific. Hilton Worldwide Holdings Inc. was founded in 1919 and is headquartered in McLean, Virginia.","summary_zh":"希爾頓全球控股公司是一家酒店公司，從事酒店及度假村的管理、特許經營和租賃業務。它分為兩個部門：管理和特許經營部門以及所有權部門。該公司從事酒店管理以及其品牌名稱、商標和服務標誌的許可。它經營豪華、生活方式、全方位服務、專注服務、全套房酒店和分時度假的品牌組合，旗下有華爾道夫酒店及度假村、LXR 酒店及度假村、康萊德酒店及度假村、Signia by Hilton、NoMad、Canopy by Hilton、Graduate by Hilton、Tempo by Hilton Collection、Motto Cur by Hilton Collection、希爾頓酒店及Graduate by Hilton、Tempby by Hilton Collection、Motto Cur by Hilton Collection、希爾頓酒店及希爾頓酒店by Hilton、Embassy Suites by Hilton、希爾頓惠庭套房酒店、希爾頓惠庭套房酒店、LivSmart Studios by Hilton、希爾頓花園酒店、希爾頓歡朋酒店、Tru by Hilton、Spark by Hilton、希爾頓分時度假俱樂部、世界小型豪華酒店、AutoCamp 和希爾頓榮譽客會品牌。該公司在北美、南美和中美洲（包括多個加勒比海國家）開展業務；歐洲、中東和非洲；和亞太地區。希爾頓全球控股公司成立於 1919 年，總部位於維吉尼亞州麥克萊恩。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"住宿","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":277.55,"h":278.01,"l":272.94,"c":274.07,"v":1242200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":274.36,"h":276.96,"l":273.5,"c":275.34,"v":1366000},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":275.12,"h":277.62,"l":274.55,"c":276.4,"v":1294900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":277.62,"h":277.65,"l":275.82,"c":276.3,"v":1728900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":274.4,"h":277.59,"l":273.04,"c":276.06,"v":1108700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":273.1,"h":276.26,"l":271.06,"c":276.01,"v":1856000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":275.78,"h":279.73,"l":274.63,"c":275.0,"v":1244700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":275.74,"h":279.26,"l":274.68,"c":278.06,"v":2003600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":278.2,"h":279.81,"l":270.23,"c":272.3,"v":1578800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":272.45,"h":277.9,"l":271.87,"c":277.8,"v":1544700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":277.08,"h":277.41,"l":274.71,"c":274.97,"v":863200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":274.31,"h":275.68,"l":271.61,"c":273.1,"v":1131800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":273.49,"h":278.78,"l":272.54,"c":278.22,"v":958700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":277.83,"h":277.89,"l":274.69,"c":274.73,"v":703600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":274.81,"h":275.18,"l":271.18,"c":271.25,"v":1442800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":271.74,"h":274.25,"l":270.55,"c":273.88,"v":112670